{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1000_p", "source_sha256": "23ba3c144fa86c281e609799b79b38c7259dae933a30c4a61a3dd1022aab5824", "ja": "（そろそろ、次の定期公演のレッスンが始まる。\n今回の目玉は、静香の新曲お披露目だ）", "zh": "（下一场定期公演的训练差不多要开始了。这次的看点是静香的新歌首次亮相。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6aa86735624850ee8dc45564a8e002b176a900cef0940387682ef625d9669e0b", "ja": "お疲れさま……お、静香、いたのか。\nちょうどよかった。", "zh": "辛苦了……哦，静香，你在啊。\n正好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "79652092f9c4c504cb8f37a3fb7f676f75d5b9b71769cef03ba182c2dc3e553c", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nお、お疲れさまです……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n您、您辛苦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e2f4fd227a972e10222407a4b67d8e1925f53cd5623a94649116924d05106e55", "ja": "？　……静香、声が少し変だな。\n風邪でも引いたのか？", "zh": "？……静香，你的声音听起来有点不对劲。是感冒了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "b1a097edd84d885dbeb0ff5566d737413d71e3d4424fa8f3f5b18f2fad39126c", "ja": "ちょっと、喉の調子が悪いだけです。\n帰ったらケアするので、心配いりません。", "zh": "只是嗓子有点不舒服而已。\n回去后我会护理一下，不用担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1005_p", "source_sha256": "fe484d09dc9595af4d44f4ecf6a12279150dce3d4963033e623faac177f01082", "ja": "そうか。次の定期公演だけど、\nセットリストが決まったから先に渡しておくよ。", "zh": "这样啊。下次的定期公演，演出曲目已经定下来了，我先交给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "5bbb8a6b0f536c2b665fb3da729563185a4bef4dc595e6a293393af2194fdbca", "ja": "は、はいっ、ありがとうございます！\n新曲ですもんね。がんばらないと……。", "zh": "好、好的，谢谢您！\n这是新歌嘛。得加油才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8a545e839fdc073012a0fb23eaa42d614027bf8a618a4910897ae5d5b2c673a1", "ja": "気合いが入っているのはいいけど、くれぐれも\n無理はしないでくれよ。体調がよくないなら尚更だ。", "zh": "有干劲是好事，但千万别勉强自己。要是身体状况不好，就更不能勉强了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "7adbb991129e5fe8316bc484694b2ec6d1db62b15222235968dc2f69cb56699c", "ja": "も、もう、わかってますってば！\n子ども扱いしないでください。", "zh": "真是的，我都明白啦！\n请别把我当成小孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "46bfb47c2a06571a08c352fbd084e6ad1ac804e2acd83951ff5a6d2ac8a92831", "ja": "それじゃ、お疲れさまでした！　失礼します！", "zh": "那么，辛苦了！我先告辞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1010_se", "source_sha256": "da55577bb898d8a9ee681e05a77e2569dab50715b4e0f16f49edeb2dbbbeab1d", "ja": "パタン！", "zh": "啪嗒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1011_null", "source_sha256": "3f412edfb664dc3dd550962c1a75cea3cc407f220069b2291c3ec50a3200ad27", "ja": "数日後、レッスン初日……", "zh": "几天后，课程第一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5b5be266a590e2648c3eea2d6cb3f9e2689734548dada2ae076c5ac5c048e153", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\n今日から定期公演のレッスン開始だ。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n从今天开始进行定期公演的练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ae1da94baf67365590dec1f2f035c60e6a7fc0523a1eb90c704823f43ce19f93", "ja": "次の公演は、静香の新曲お披露目がメインだ。\n本人は……今日は、休みだけど。", "zh": "下一场公演的主要内容，是静香新曲的首次亮相。\n不过她本人……今天休息。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "66a7aa794451c2437d17af908942c71d406e1fada2be8f6ac3c9b36727056a36", "ja": "静香ちゃん、風邪をひいてしまったんですよね？\nひどくないといいんですけど。", "zh": "静香感冒了，对吧？\n希望不要太严重。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "848f9be52e80d640981edb3efa40ee4ab08fd32deff617beeac37460a7c8c658", "ja": "最近、空気が乾燥してたから……。\nきちんとケアしていても、ちょっと辛かったものね。", "zh": "最近空气太干燥了……\n就算好好护理，还是有点难受呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1016_p", "source_sha256": "762ead42c1083f0e1482da37d299c13b64ee42b4a440ba28f6ee3de1ce97d696", "ja": "そういう事だ。本人も気をつけていたし、調子が悪いと\n聞いた時点で、休むようには話してたんだけどな。", "zh": "就是这么回事。她本人也一直很注意，听说她状态不太好时，我也跟她说过要休息，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f2ea7d247e5993c4973020afe81230d8749258c92281b6e95ba994a8f015b51f", "ja": "体調ばかりは、仕方がない。\nセンターが不在でも、できるところは進めておこう！", "zh": "身体状况这种事，确实没办法。\n即使静香不在，能做的部分也先推进吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "e786997762e7d3b0de6bba57694543d182676259d6456e73564e53713fe5b1f3", "ja": "もちろんです。静香が戻ってきた時、\nしっかり合わせられるよう、頑張ります。", "zh": "那是当然。等静香回来的时候，\n为了能好好配合她，我会努力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "2f469ee1beef93eef2cf229a4ad5c3e7ccad9125abb1e247a0d7cbcff3581b09", "ja": "けど、静香大丈夫かな？　ちゃんと\n休んでればいいけど、静香ってこういう時……。", "zh": "不过，静香没事吧？要是她能好好休息就好了，可静香在这种时候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1020_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "18bc1edd3776521ee8b2b54120d44517cabcca7cd3e8b346fc83024611b46641", "ja": "お疲れさまです……コホッ。", "zh": "辛苦了……咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1022_p", "source_sha256": "402e1de7e5193b5b7e1937a1d0346714be298f26ef65936dd2df027d7bded517", "ja": "静香！？", "zh": "静香！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1023_052kao", "source_sha256": "86d31f12526df9fac5d1e1cadff7945ba687a48cf11f1e3ffaba29ab69f2c6ee", "ja": "静香ちゃん！？", "zh": "静香！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "86d31f12526df9fac5d1e1cadff7945ba687a48cf11f1e3ffaba29ab69f2c6ee", "ja": "静香ちゃん！？", "zh": "静香！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1025_p", "source_sha256": "4478fbf3ea238990274140e4e45bfc53c4262a93bd9829c7bf3f508947bb1479", "ja": "どうしたんだ、静香。\n今日のレッスンは休みだって連絡してきたのに……。", "zh": "怎么了，静香。\n明明已经联系过说今天的练习休息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "5cfa27a784dc8e867c12eaa7b7fb37d5873a677b68af35e8d0d515946d456a4d", "ja": "そうですけど、私の新曲公演なのに、\n寝ているわけには……みんなにも、迷惑をかけますし。", "zh": "是这样没错，可这是我的新歌演出，我不能一直睡着……也会给大家添麻烦的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "2519294ca18cf7268c1e2be2e59d35f2936409595f5977abc71184ad8d5e48c7", "ja": "あきれた。風邪をひいている人に、無理に\nレッスンに参加されるほうが、迷惑なんだけど。", "zh": "真是的。让感冒的人硬撑着参加训练，才会给大家添麻烦呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "f65886badd8e1defaeb547617a7d063b7e71347c0d845ed1e600bafa6b476aa7", "ja": "うっ。", "zh": "呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1029_p", "source_sha256": "eed88c75746c7a94b83dcdcfc30b280da6b580107927225c8dab0e74a7b35178", "ja": "ま、まあまあ……言い方はキツかったかもしれないけど\n志保の言う通りだ、静香。治るまでちゃんと休もう。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……虽然说法可能有点重，但志保说得没错，静香。在痊愈之前好好休息吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1030_052kao", "source_sha256": "f3457f71691c13490158935e6d866c4da2b77770d7abc4e018f2980e257beaae", "ja": "そうよ、静香ちゃん。\nしっかり休んで、早く治さなくちゃ。", "zh": "是啊，静香。\n好好休息，得赶快养好才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1031_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d72ef4e4119744de3b6f89846abf3bae9eba5cd1cff6d1a53e763b68c899afc4", "ja": "自分では、あまりわからないかもしれないけど……\n風邪を引いている時って、免疫力が落ちてるんだ。", "zh": "你自己可能不太感觉得到……\n但人在感冒的时候，免疫力会下降的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1032_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8249800ff78f67aeda2f538d4cee9d0bc6016ad393fcc2fe38da42830caecf3d", "ja": "今無理をすると、かえって悪化しちゃうかも\nしれないの。だから、ね？", "zh": "现在勉强自己的话，反而可能会恶化的。所以，听话，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "3d1573bedfcad5a21934eccbc9a867571f52db9fc62a67c038d29abf0b682b56", "ja": "歌織さん、風花さん……。\nでも……。", "zh": "歌织小姐、风花小姐……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1034_003mik", "source_sha256": "46a95f4f52a0c78e4286b11ef84e9d3981440ebe6b384fd4de9da1b5cb5e22a6", "ja": "やっぱりなの。\n静香なら、無理して来そうって思ったの。", "zh": "果然是这样。\n美希就知道静香肯定会勉强自己跑过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1035_015siz", "source_sha256": "ddc93f0d7e907007c3437fa4658c50f5b785e3c8eaa8e42ce030c4810635ec19", "ja": "美希さん……。", "zh": "美希……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1036_003mik", "source_sha256": "36acd82c92ae9e68bde1ff552443df6838e16a691c48a50993c0b305a761f4d1", "ja": "そういうとこ、静香って、\nけっこうコドモっぽいよね。", "zh": "静香在这种地方，还挺孩子气的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_121_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_121_1037_015siz", "source_sha256": "c8cd994cc0c4e08e4bbc761b0cf41e9848de13a3ad7217370c322a1283638b9a", "ja": "ううっ！", "zh": "呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
